# Population SQL Transformation Work

## Summary

Generated Access SQL queries to convert population-specific wide tables into a common long-format structure. Each query produces one record per population/year and excludes the `Sort Order` field.

Because the combined `UNION ALL` query exceeded Access's complexity limit, the recommended approach is to use individual append queries for each saved population query.

